{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13209230","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13209230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1320923001:1":{"text":"묘지기 아저씨, 유령 아주머니의 관이 너무 낡아서 새 관이 필요해요. 공동 묘지에 있을까요?","source_cn":"巡墓人大叔，幽灵大婶的棺材腐烂得很严重，需要一口新棺材...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00B06C11F1EF64D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320923002:1":{"text":"없지. 공동 묘지에 빈 관을 둘 이유가 없으니까.","source_cn":"没有，墓园里没事放那么多空棺材干嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55342AB94E5FF1A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320923003:1":{"text":"하지만 근처에 <style=\"highlight\">단단한 소나무 목재</style>가 많이 있지. 튼튼하고 습기에도 강하니, 목재를 가져오면 관을 만들어 주마.","source_cn":"不过附近倒是有挺多<style=highlight>硬...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x301FBE785B637F07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320923004:1":{"text":"와, 감사합니다! 그럼 바로 목재를 모으러 갈게요!","source_cn":"哇，谢谢大叔！我们现在就去收集木材！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x390D67E08F74944E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:瑙姆":{"text":"나움","source":"瑙姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:巡墓人齐诺维":{"text":"지노비","source":"巡墓人齐诺维","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}